{
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_dorp.1": "Welcome to the Mijnguh village! Here we dig, we nibble and then we dig some more.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_dorp.2": "Bulk is lovely! The Mijnguh in the stall trades building stuff for nibbles.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_dorp.3": "The sauce lake is warm. Swimming is allowed, slurping is not. I tried. Njeg.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_dorp.4": "Above us lies a whole mountain of pink wool. We just live under it. Cosy, right?",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_dorp.5": "The side tunnels lead to the neighbours. Be quiet near the dormitory!",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_gids.1": "I'm Granny Pluis, the guide. Long ago everything was grey and cold. Brr!",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_gids.2": "Then a guh found the very first pink ball of wool. Look, up there on the wall!",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_gids.3": "Spinning, spinning, spinning... and that's how the whole Guhmension turned pink.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_gids.4": "Every guh carries a little piece of the Cuddle Heart. You share it by being kind.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_gids.5": "Don't touch, please: the paint is only three thousand years old.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_ingang.1": "Going down? Step onto the little cloud. The ladder is fine too, for the brave.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_ingang.2": "The mine is at the bottom. Bring a lamp, it's darker down there than inside a bag of cheese nibbles.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_ingang.3": "Two little clouds: one goes up, one goes down. Don't mix them up, njeg!",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_ingang.4": "I'm the lift guh. I don't press any buttons, but I do stand here very professionally.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_mijn.1": "This mine is older than my grandma. And my grandma is very old.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_mijn.2": "First nibble, then dig. Guhs have done it this way for ages.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_mijn.3": "The tunnels go every which way. I got lost three times myself. Today.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_mijn.4": "There are still little sleds full of loot here. Help yourself, the old miner guhs retired long ago.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_paddenstoel.1": "Welcome to our little village! Knock first, then you climb right up the stem.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_paddenstoel.2": "My house is in the cap. Mind your head, it's only a little hat.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_paddenstoel.3": "Lights on strings, a sparkly brook, mushrooms: what more could a guh want?",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_paddenstoel.4": "No, you may not eat my house. Not even a tiny bite. Njeg!",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_slaapzaal.1": "Shhh... the baby guhs are asleep. If they wake up, everybody wants a nibble.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_slaapzaal.2": "Counting sheep helps. I always fall asleep myself at sheep number three.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_slaapzaal.3": "The alarm clock is set to never. That's the best time around here.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_slaapzaal.4": "Pet a sleeping guh very gently, and it wakes up happy.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_visser.1": "I'm Henk Hengel. They're not biting today. Only the cheese is.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_visser.2": "Caught today: zero fish and three socks. A good day!",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_visser.3": "A fishing licence costs one nibble. I ate it myself.",
  "quest.guhs.onderwol_bouw.onderwol_visser.4": "The sauce is warm. Don't drink it, do dip in it.",
